k strikes from south of Stalingrad.","arrow":{"from":[48.4,44.45],"to":[48.58,43.9],"side":"B"}},{"date":"1942-11-23","text":"The two pincers meet near Kalach. The German 6th Army is trapped in the Stalingrad pocket.","arrow":null},{"date":"1942-12-12","text":"Operation Winter Storm: German forces attack from Kotelnikovo to break the ring.","arrow":{"from":[47.7,43.15],"to":[48.2,43.85],"side":"A"}},{"date":"1942-12-16","text":"Operation Little Saturn: a Soviet offensive smashes the Italian 8th Army on the Don.","arrow":{"from":[49.85,40.9],"to":[48.55,41.35],"side":"B"}},{"date":"1942-12-24","text":"The relief attack is stopped short of the pocket and pulls back.","arrow":null},{"date":"1943-01-10","text":"Operation Ring: the final Soviet assault on the pocket begins.","arrow":{"from":[48.7,43.75],"to":[48.72,44.2],"side":"B"}},{"date":"1943-01-16","text":"Pitomnik, the pocket's main airfield, falls.","arrow":null},{"date":"1943-01-31","text":"Field Marshal Paulus surrenders in the southern part of the city.","arrow":null},{"date":"1943-02-02","text":"The last German troops in Stalingrad surrender. The battle is over.","arrow":null}],"short_center":[44.0,48.65],"thumb_date":"1942-11-23","thumb_text":"Stalingrad","parts":{"b":{"from":"1943-01-08","to":"1943-02-02","title":"The Last 26 Days of Stalingrad","subtitle":"Operation Ring, January 1943"}},"yt":{"long_title":"Battle of Stalingrad: Operation Uranus, Every Day on the Map (1942-1943)","short_a_title":"Stalingrad in 55 seconds: how the Soviets trapped a whole German army 🗺️","short_b_title":"The last 26 days of Stalingrad, day by day 🗺️","about":"On 19 November 1942 the Red Army launched Operation Uranus, broke through the Romanian armies on both flanks of Stalingrad and closed the ring at Kalach four days later. The German 6th Army was trapped. A relief attack (Operation Winter Storm) failed, Operation Little Saturn smashed the Italian 8th Army on the Don, and Operation Ring crushed the pocket in January. Field Marshal Paulus surrendered on 31 January and the last German troops in the city gave up on 2 February 1943.","tags":["Stalingrad","Battle of Stalingrad","Operation Uranus","WW2","World War 2","Eastern Front","history map","day by day","front line map","6th Army","Paulus","Red Army"]}}